        "At the hearth, the fire is your life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "TIME",
      "how": "frozen in the city, running out at the hearth",
      "card": [
        "Wake the frozen. Relive their last ten seconds.",
        "Ash is time. Spend it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SHADOW",
      "how": "shadows hold you up, and one hunts you",
      "card": [
        "Walk on your own shadow.",
        "One shadow moves only when you look away."
      ]
    }
